## Limits

- Strapi upload cap: **256MB** default via `STRAPI_MAX_UPLOAD_SIZE_MB` ([`config/middlewares.ts`](apps/backend/config/middlewares.ts), [`config/plugins.ts`](apps/backend/config/plugins.ts))
- Importer video cap: `IMPORT_VIDEOS_MAX_SIZE` (default 256MB — keep in sync with Strapi)
- Images still converted to WebP via `sharp`; videos uploaded raw
